{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10272020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10272020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1027202001:1":{"text":"무슨 일이야?","source_cn":"发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDDAFBFDC1527FB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027202002:0":{"text":"라이카 대장님, 달빛호수 마을의 욜란다가 포탈로 들어간 후 돌아오지 않았어요!","source_cn":"莱卡队长，月湖村的约兰达进入传送阵后一直没有返回！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C9FA12551EA4A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027202003:0":{"text":"욜란다는 포탈 너머에 어떤 풍경이 펼쳐지는지 보고 싶다고 했어요. 하지만 이렇게 오랫동안 돌아오지 않을리가 없어요.","source_cn":"按照她的说法，她只是想看看传送石阵通往哪里，那边的景色...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CCE75A43742998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1027202003":{"text":"욜란다는 포탈 너머에 어떤 풍경이 펼쳐지는지 보고 싶다고 했어요. 하지만 이렇게 오랫동안 돌아오지 않을리가 없어요.","source_cn":"按照她的说法，她只是想看看传送石阵通往哪里，那边的景色如何，不应该这么久都不回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CCE75A43742998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027202004:0":{"text":"음, 이건 고대로부터 전해 내려온 텔레포트 장치에요. 흔한 게 아닌데...","source_cn":"嗯，这是古时候遗留下来的传送机关，并不多见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD63864CE34CF452D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_